  {
    "name": "get_box_score",
    "title": "Get a box score",
    "description": "Get the player stat lines of one game, grouped by stat category, with player names and teams. Filter with team, an id or abbreviation; player, part of a name, ignoring accents; and category, such as passing, rushing, receiving, defensive, interceptions, fumbles, kicking, punting, kick_returns, punt_returns, soccer. With no filter on a big game it returns the top lines of each category, sets truncated and says how to see the rest. Statpad doesn't fill team totals or score by period yet. For a team total, add up that team's player lines for the category, and say the total is summed from player lines.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "league": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9]*$",
